WEBVTT

00:01:58.614 --> 00:02:01.367
Won’t look down, won’t open my eyes

00:02:01.367 --> 00:02:03.953
Keep my glass full until morning light

00:02:03.953 --> 00:02:06.706
Because I’m just holding on for tonight

00:02:06.747 --> 00:02:08.291
On for tonight

00:02:08.332 --> 00:02:09.458
Sun is up

00:02:10.918 --> 00:02:13.713
Adesso, vediamo il video un’altra volta.

00:02:14.088 --> 00:02:16.299
Vi mostro cosa ha ispirato quei movimenti,

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:19.677
la loro semplicità vi lascerà di stucco.

00:02:20.011 --> 00:02:21.721
(Senza musica)

00:02:21.762 --> 00:02:24.348
Forchetta, forchetta, forchetta,
coltellata al muro,

00:02:24.473 --> 00:02:26.184
lascia e svieni,

00:02:26.225 --> 00:02:27.393
riprendi i sensi,

00:02:27.393 --> 00:02:28.394
e guarda;

00:02:28.394 --> 00:02:30.980
Charlie Chaplin, Charlie Chaplin,
scarafaggio sul muro,